      "raw": "<p>Hello All,</p><p>I wanted to introduce myself, my name is Dennis. I got introduced to Sentinels of the Multiverse about 3 weeks ago and I was hooked. I have since then I have Purchased Sentinels of the Multiverse: Enhanced Edition, Rook City &amp; Infernal Relics, Shattered Timelines, and Vengeance. And have got all the Mini-Expansion Cards. I wanted to share my Storage Solution.</p><p>First off thanks to Spiff for all his great stuff: <a href=\"http://spiffworld.com/sotm/\">http://spiffworld.com/sotm/</a></p><p><em><u>On the tachyon - super scientific - burst tracker you&rsquo;re missing the little white triangle.</u></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So I am using: 2000x Ultra Pro Standard Card Sleeves (Penny Sleeves) 20 Packs</p><p><a href=\"http://www.newegg.com/Product/Product.aspx?Item=9SIA3P317B5929\">http://www.newegg.com/Product/Product.aspx?Item=9SIA3P317B5929</a></p><p>Vaultz Locking Storage Chest, Black:</p><p><a href=\"http://www.walmart.com/ip/32285825?www=true&amp;productRedirect=true\">http://www.walmart.com/ip/32285825?www=true&amp;productRedirect=true</a></p><p>Avery Slide and View Expanding File Folder:</p><p><a href=\"http://www.walmart.com/ip/Avery-Slide-and-View-Expanding-File-Folder/33167257\">http://www.walmart.com/ip/Avery-Slide-and-View-Expanding-File-Folder/33167257</a></p><p>The case is a Vaultz:</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfOFlOekRkVnh5ems/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfOFlOekRkVnh5ems/view?usp=sharing</a></p><p>And as it has room for some expansion using Spiff&rsquo;s boxes. Here is a Pic:</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfTnpoR0NVXzB0ZEE/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfTnpoR0NVXzB0ZEE/view?usp=sharing</a></p><p>Then I use the Expanding file for all my Hit Point Trackers:</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfNUdKVEY5WVhYTFU/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfNUdKVEY5WVhYTFU/view?usp=sharing</a></p><p>And it goes right on top:</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfeUc3SFFCeEF5cmM/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfeUc3SFFCeEF5cmM/view?usp=sharing</a></p><p>Closes up tight:</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfY3cxeENaNWhtZHM/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfY3cxeENaNWhtZHM/view?usp=sharing</a></p><p>And has a Handle on each side:</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfYjVUcVh2Yy1qZ0E/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwHM5al0PayfYjVUcVh2Yy1qZ0E/view?usp=sharing</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So that is what I use Penny sleeves $17; Case $30 ; Folder $8; so for around $55 dollars a good Transporting Solution.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just need to get Wrath of the Cosmos, and the Villain Oversized Cards, and I will have great set, thanks for the fun GTG.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Dennis</p>",
