      "raw": "[quote=\"dshields\"]\nHello All,I wanted to introduce myself, my name is Dennis. I got introduced to Sentinels of the Multiverse about 3 weeks ago and I was hooked. I have since then I have Purchased Sentinels of the Multiverse: Enhanced Edition, Rook City &amp; Infernal Relics, Shattered Timelines, and Vengeance. And have got all the Mini-Expansion Cards. I wanted to share my Storage Solution.\n[/quote]\n\nWelcome to the forums!\n\nI think this probably should go in its own thread, but while we&#39;re here I just wanted to say I really like your setup. I might consider picking up that storage box, it looks like it&#39;s got plenty of room for future sets, as well as dice, counters, oversize villians, etc.\n\nDo you think using the standard dividers would work well in that box?\n",
