      "id": 123733,
      "name": "dshields",
      "username": "dshields",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dshields/{size}/1968_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-16T21:24:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Craig\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/48/2150_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Craig:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Followed by the expansions after WotC… <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Well It has room for 2 and 1/2 rows. IF I take out Spiffs extra Enviroment&nbsp; Boxs and Promo Box.</p>\n<p>So thats 14 hero sets &nbsp;or 18 Villian sets or 20 Enviroment sets that fit in one row</p>\n<p>2 Hero sets 4 Vilian Sets and 2 Enviroment set in&nbsp;Wrath of the Cosmos will fill up the 1/2 row</p>\n<p>So 2 more full rows to go</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n&nbsp;",
